{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07538","headline":"杂诗六首 六 · 李华","name":"杂诗六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结交得书生，书生钝且直。\n争权复争利，终不得其力。\n我逢纵横者，是我牙与翼。\n相旋如疾风，竝命趋紫极。\n奔车得停轨，风火何相逼。\n仁义岂有常，肝胆反爲贼。\n勿嫌书生直，钝直深可忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}